---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookies | Low Value Content" description="How the Low Value Content website uses cookies and similar browser technologies.">
  <article class="policy">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">Draft · October 16, 2026</p><h1>Cookies.</h1><p>The current public storefront does not intentionally set advertising, analytics, personalization, or marketing cookies.</p></header>
    <section><h2>Current public site</h2><p>The public experience does not currently include a cookie preference manager because no optional tracking technologies have been enabled. Hosting infrastructure may use necessary technical mechanisms to deliver and protect the service.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Development and staging</h2><p>Restricted non-production environments use Google and Firebase for sign-in and session storage to remember an authorized email address during the browser session. Those environments are for internal review and are not the public storefront.</p></section>
    <section><h2>External services</h2><p>Social platforms and the restricted Stripe test-checkout experience may use their own cookies after a visitor follows a link or enters those services. Their notices and controls apply there.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Future state</h2><p>If measurement, email, personalization, advertising, or public commerce tools are added, this page and any legally required consent controls will be updated before those tools are enabled.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Browser controls</h2><p>Visitors can review or delete stored site data through their browser settings. At present, there is no optional Low Value Content cookie preference to manage on the public site.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .policy{padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,10rem) clamp(1.25rem,9vw,10rem);background:var(--paper)}
  header{max-width:900px;margin-bottom:5rem}h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,9rem);line-height:.86;font-weight:400;margin:1rem 0 2rem}header>p:last-child{max-width:760px;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.7}.policy section{max-width:820px;padding:2.25rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}h2{font-size:2rem;font-weight:400;margin:.2rem 0 1rem}.policy section p{line-height:1.75;margin:0}
</style>
